## ============================================================
##  CONFIGURATION & SECRETS
##  Commit appsettings.json (shared config). Ignore secrets and
##  per-developer/per-environment overrides ONLY.
## ============================================================
## Ignore local/secret overrides:
appsettings.*.local.json
appsettings.Local.json
appsettings.Development.local.json
*.secrets.json
secrets.json

## Do NOT ignore committed config (explicit un-ignore for safety):
!appsettings.json
!appsettings.Development.json
!appsettings.Production.json

## launchSettings is developer-specific (ports, env vars) — usually not committed:
**/Properties/launchSettings.json

## --- EF Core --------------------------------------------------------------
